  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At Chuy\u2019s, the sauce, sides, and preparation can change a meal almost as much as the entr\u00e9e itself.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     An enchilada covered in Boom-Boom Sauce has a different nutrition profile from one topped with Green Chile or Ranchero Sauce. A fajita meal also includes more than grilled meat once tortillas, rice, beans, cheese, guacamole, and other toppings are added.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare menu items and calculate the calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, sodium, and other available nutrition values in the meal you actually order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.oupagxr10yp4\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s Signature Sauces Make a Real Difference\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauces are a central part of the Chuy\u2019s menu, not just a small garnish.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The restaurant currently offers nine made-from-scratch sauces ranging from Tangy Tomatillo and Roasted Ranchero to Creamy Green Chile, Boom-Boom, and Hatch Green Chile.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These sauces do not all have the same nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, Chuy\u2019s current nutrition information lists approximately:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Hatch Green Chile Sauce: 25 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Tangy Tomatillo: 60 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Roasted Ranchero: 60 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Creamy Green Chile: 170 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Boom-Boom Sauce: 200 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Queso: 230 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If your burrito, enchiladas, or flautas come with a specific sauce, make sure that preparation is reflected in your calculation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.1lcewl2eo7c6\">\n<span>\n     Enchilada Calories Depend on the Filling and Sauce\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s enchiladas come in several different styles.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cheese, seasoned ground beef, roasted chicken, veggie, and creamy green chile chicken enchiladas all contain different amounts of protein, carbohydrates, fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The sauce matters too.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, current official nutrition information lists:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Veggie Enchiladas: about 340 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Deluxe Chicken Enchiladas: about 470 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicka-Chicka Boom-Boom Enchiladas: about 540 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Tex-Mex Enchiladas: about 630 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Those entr\u00e9e values should still be checked carefully because Chuy\u2019s notes that certain sides or sauces may not be included in the nutrition analysis for some menu entries.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.jd0t6h9uisrn\">\n<span>\n     Fajitas Are More Than the Protein\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Chuy\u2019s fajita order includes several components.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The grilled chicken or beef is only the beginning. Tortillas, rice, beans, cheese, guacamole, pico de gallo, and other accompaniments can all contribute to the final total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For a useful estimate, think of the meal as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein + tortillas + rice + beans + toppings\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you eat only part of the tortillas or skip some of the sides, your actual intake may differ from the full restaurant serving.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5u1rrmevh5hw\">\n<span>\n     Burritos Can Change With the Sauce on Top\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s burritos are another category where the finished preparation matters.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Steak Burrito topped with Hatch Green Chile Sauce is nutritionally different from a burrito filled with another protein or covered with a richer sauce.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current menu also includes a Tex-Mex Burrito Bowl built with rice, cheese, peppers and onions, corn salsa, pico de gallo, guacamole, lettuce, and fajita chicken or beef.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A bowl and a burrito should therefore not be treated as interchangeable simply because they use similar fillings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.3rz71ic0gqm8\">\n<span>\n     Queso, Chips, and Creamy Jalape\u00f1o Belong in the Total\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s serves complimentary chips and salsa, and its FAQ also highlights Creamy Jalape\u00f1o as a popular addition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These extras can be easy to forget because they may arrive before the main meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Queso and Creamy Jalape\u00f1o are especially important to count separately because they can add substantial calories, fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current NutritionSolver data, for example, lists a 4 oz Creamy Jalape\u00f1o serving at roughly\n    </span>\n<span>\n     410 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you share chips, queso, or another appetizer, estimate the portion you actually eat rather than assigning the entire table serving to one person.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.n5b19qbg52zr\">\n<span>\n     Combination Plates Need Extra Attention\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s serves several combination-style meals, including items such as Comida Deluxe, Chicken Flautas, Chuychanga, Taco &amp; Enchilada combinations, and other house specialties.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These meals can combine tortillas, fried items, cheese, sauces, guacamole, rice, beans, and multiple proteins on one plate.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current official nutrition chart lists\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Comida Deluxe at about 1,190 calories before certain side considerations\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , showing why a combo meal should be treated differently from a single taco or enchilada.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the exact entr\u00e9e whenever possible rather than trying to estimate a combination from one component.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ckiwcoxbhjkl\">\n<span>\n     Sodium Can Be High Even When Calories Look Moderate\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Calories are not the only useful comparison at Chuy\u2019s.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cheese, tortillas, seasoned meats, sauces, queso, beans, and combination dishes can contribute significant sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, two entr\u00e9es may have similar calories but substantially different sodium totals depending on the sauce and ingredients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If sodium matters to you, compare it after accounting for the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     main dish, sauce, sides, and dips\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.agfhrc5rmo4a\">\n<span>\n     Chuy\u2019s Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Chuy\u2019s queso?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Chicka-Chicka Boom-Boom Enchiladas?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Chuy\u2019s sauce add calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are rice and beans always included in Chuy\u2019s entr\u00e9e calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Chuy\u2019s chips and salsa included in entr\u00e9e calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.4z5ek4cl2jzw\">\n<span>\n     Calculate the Whole Chuy\u2019s Meal\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The most useful Chuy\u2019s nutrition result comes from looking at the complete plate rather than the entr\u00e9e name alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with the exact\n    </span>\n<span>\n     enchilada, fajita, burrito, taco, or house specialty\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , then account for the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     sauce, rice, beans, tortillas, queso, dips, chips, and drinks\n    </span>\n<span>\n     you actually consume.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver can then give you a more realistic view of the calories and macros in your full Tex-Mex order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
